{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e41aaa392468150a87f4fb1a762831433ecf88b977c83c554c737bb7a26c74",
      "text": "跨越时空的邂逅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c946da8e99d79727f98afa39df62649d0b73daf75e2210f8809a6da00767b85",
      "text": "彩将在男极‘同步部门’中，演唱以\n观众寄来的‘回忆信件’为蓝本创作的\n歌曲。\n为了与信中的情感同步，他们前往了写信人的\n故乡，也是九郎的故乡——镰仓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4fe9663b1c30cef05a726883179c94adc263067b1d6df8b2aef98e90574c49",
      "text": "第5话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e41aaa392468150a87f4fb1a762831433ecf88b977c83c554c737bb7a26c74",
      "text": "跨越时空的邂逅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4212176da6ba3521378ad8b10b8d7475c150e5159b95d4fb0f1bbf0262d2e14",
      "text": "镰仓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bc6dce17c6c349dd951ae73019caa75803f9ae274adce9d8467bf41101843fc",
      "text": "紫薯冰淇淋，可真好吃喵。\n到现在嘴里还洋溢着满满的幸福感喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a47cd548cfa5a2c0b3edaf67deca18abe40d3d44e5929122e31ba7600ee7f93",
      "text": "镰仓有好多美食呢。\n刚烤好的仙贝也超级美味呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc06985e68e38f80d5c67e702b1213a9c643d45d542a39896965db8603737ef1",
      "text": "你们两个，居然玩得这么开心……。\n我们可不是来玩的哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a3f69b4e8d7065fbf4e0485cd67793c12526b1588f1a940818b43ba5f0e6064",
      "text": "男极‘同步部门’是要根据观众寄来的\n回忆信件所创作的歌曲来进行演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd9f453ea13055b3144ed60681002a89b9c5ebff0468adda3c3a43168c388ad0",
      "text": "能否带来贴近人心的舞台表演，\n我们必须展现出这份实力才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:171ad610920077034d4ea2a2b3875e75707b5ccb96dab0cc90c3aa95367adfab",
      "text": "彩负责的就是那封信呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110ee2e5658029846d88258d3ba99eae75f87010cca3cae4c9792da1d5c892ce",
      "text": "是的。从这上面写着的‘笹龙胆’和\n‘海棠’来推测，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0daf6b7a70749f58b184f8ca29a7b04df8813129b358608e638cc9e9b4d6528",
      "text": "寄信人曾经居住的地方大概就是镰仓吧。\n笹龙胆是镰仓市的市徽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8bb21c07c44b751a7d5b04e465a62b1c9c81ce56a46d9f528556f3ffa20c129",
      "text": "这封信似乎是离开镰仓的寄信人，\n写给故乡友人的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb349b825610a3753f223ee5a2b4ed1cfb556ad19afca30a3e23ba6f218b4de",
      "text": "游历镰仓体会信中的心意，\n并在当天的音乐节目中完美地演唱出来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29fa9925863254dff7e0b2982b5f2712f9da426a8a769c8dc6302072d02b6467",
      "text": "下一场男极‘同步部门’的胜利者，非彩莫属！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6045133be6304db99a55c3ea83ef7de0820bf6ff4fca268db0f5a4d7766b8dfb",
      "text": "那是当然的喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045d3fddbf9681d26f581c7f6b6e2708630ce24715d3d2cd25787056c4cd9cbc",
      "text": "我们当然是这么打算的啦。\n……不过有件事稍微有点让人在意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
